## HAWS Codex adapter

Load canonical rules from `core/HAWS.md` and `core/WORK_INSTRUCTIONS.md`, and
private preferences from the connected Second Brain:
`secondbrain/USER_PREFERENCES.md` and `secondbrain/ANTI_PATTERNS.md`.

Use the HAWS `skills/` and `agents/` catalogs when a task requires a skill or
delegation. This adapter is registration metadata only and contains no copied
rules.
